12 rounded-2xl bg-soft-green text-deep-green flex items-center justify-center mb-6"> <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 4v11m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4M5 20h14"></path></svg> </div> <p class="text-xs font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-deep-green mb-3">Specify and source</p> <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3 group-hover:text-deep-green transition-colors">Download Center</h3> <p class="text-slate leading-relaxed mb-6">Access available datasheets, understand which documents are project-specific, and request the right technical pack.</p> <span class="font-heading font-bold text-sm text-deep-green group-hover:text-amber transition-colors">View documents →</span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-charcoal text-white"> <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center"> <div> <p class="text-xs font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/45 mb-4">For an active project</p> <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-4">Need the right document pack, not another generic download?</h2> <p class="text-white/65 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Send your country, roof area, building type and preferred product line. We will point you to the relevant datasheet, BOM, certification copy or quotation step.</p> </div> <a href="https://wa.me/8617729920083?text=Hi%20Sunlit%2C%20I%20am%20evaluating%20a%20solar%20roof%20project%20and%20need%20help%20selecting%20the%20right%20documents." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-amber px-6 py-3.5 font-heading font-bold text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-amber/90 whitespace-nowrap">
